.TH LIBTUIKIT 3 2026-10-03 "libtuikit 0.1" "libtuikit Manual"
.SH NAME
libtuikit, tui_version \- terminal user interface toolkit, function overview
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <tuikit/tuikit.h>
.PP
.B const char *tui_version(void);
.PP
Compile and link with
.B pkg-config --cflags --libs libtuikit
or, in CMake,
.B find_package(tuikit)
and the target
.BR tuikit::tuikit .
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR tui_version ()
returns the library's version, e.g. "0.1.0", or "0.1.0.12" for a build
twelve commits past the release.
.PP
